# The schedule in services/jobs/README.md, in UTC. A job still running at its next start is not
# started twice. The binary is named by its path: `jobs` alone is the shell's job-control builtin.
*/5 * * * * /usr/local/bin/jobs aggregate
* * * * * /usr/local/bin/jobs erase
30 2 * * * /usr/local/bin/jobs expire
